  "story": {
    "title": "Samanvi's picnic",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Samanvi was super excited today. She was going to a picnic with her friends.",
      "Samanvi and her friends went to the park they played fun games.",
      "Everyone enjoyed playing hide and seek. They found fun places to hide.",
      "It was a sunny day, they were thirsty. They wanted to have lemonade. First they wrote down the recipe for lemonade.",
      "Then Samanvi counted the number of friends to know how many glasses of lemonade they needed to make.",
      "Samanvi and her friends got the picnic basket and placed it on the grass.",
      "They took out the ingredients from the picnic basket. Lemons, water and sugar.",
      "Samanvi measured 8 glasses of water and poured it into the jug. She squeezed juice of three lemons, added eight teaspoons of sugar to the water. She stirred the mixture.",
      "The Lemonade was ready, Samanvi placed the jug of lemonade and 8 glasses on a bench.",
      "Samanvi and her friends enjoyed fresh lemonade.",
      "They packed up the things back into the picnic basket. They all went back home."
    ],
