      {
        "text_en": "The Lemonade was ready, Samanvi placed the jug of lemonade and 8 glasses on a bench.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_134000/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nước chanh đã sẵn sàng, Samanvi đặt bình nước chanh và 8 ly lên ghế dài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Samanvi and her friends enjoyed fresh lemonade.",
